---
// The homepage demo: real `weaver status` output as a plain block — no window chrome.
// An Astro component (not inline MDX) because JSX collapses whitespace inside <pre>.
---

<pre class="wv-status" aria-label="Example output from weaver status">$ weaver status
3 other active sessions
  <span class="who">claude-code</span>  refactor the auth module     <span class="dim">12s ago</span>
  <span class="who">codex</span>        add a Google OAuth provider  <span class="dim">just now</span>
  <span class="who">opencode</span>     backfill auth unit tests     <span class="dim">2m ago</span>
<span class="warn">⚠ src/auth/** claimed by claude-code — coordinate or work elsewhere</span></pre>

<style>
  .wv-status {
    margin: 2rem 0;
    padding: 0;
    border: 0;
    background: none;
    font-family: var(--sl-font-mono, ui-monospace, monospace);
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--sl-color-gray-2);
    overflow-x: auto;
  }
  .wv-status .who {
    /* Deliberately hardcoded: the demo is the single splash of color on a monochrome site. */
    color: #4cc4b0;
  }
  .wv-status .warn {
    color: #e3b341;
  }
  .wv-status .dim {
    color: var(--sl-color-gray-4);
  }
</style>
